```

---

# 8. String Slicing

Syntax

```python
string[start:end]
```

End index is **excluded**.

Examples

```python
name = "Python"

name[0:3]
```

Output

```
Pyt
```

```python
name[:4]
```

```
Pyth
```

```python
name[2:]
```

```
thon
```

```python
name[-3:]
```

```
hon
```

