# 10. Conditional Statements

## if

```python
age = 20

if age >= 18:
    print("Adult")
```

---

## if-else

```python
if marks >= 40:
    print("Pass")
else:
    print("Fail")
```

---

## if-elif-else

```python
if marks >= 90:
    print("A")
elif marks >= 80:
    print("B")
elif marks >= 70:
    print("C")
else:
    print("Fail")
```

---

## Nested if

```python
age = 65

if age >= 18:
    if age >= 60:
        print("Senior Citizen")
```

---

## Indentation

Python uses indentation instead of `{}`.

Correct

```python
if True:
    print("Hello")
```

Wrong

```python
if True:
print("Hello")
```

